From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] iommu: apple-dart: bring to #1314's final revision

Bring to its revision in aurora-silicon/linux#1314:
commit cd8de54d0a35 ("iommu: apple-dart: accept a display DART the sleep
engine rebuilt").
This tree carried an earlier revision:
commit f871c5be83db ("iommu: apple-dart: accept a display DART the sleep
engine rebuilt").
Only the difference between the two.

Based on cd8de54d0a35 from aurora-silicon/linux#1314
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
index c4496ed2cf..5bff70f207 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
@@ -6445,7 +6445,9 @@ static __maybe_unused int apple_dart_resume(struct device *dev)
 		return 0;
 	/* Powered down by its DCP, which restores it at power-up. */
 	if (READ_ONCE(dart->host_off)) {
-		dart->host_off_slept = pm_resume_via_firmware();
+		/* Rebuilt by a real sleep; an s2idle or refused sleep since leaves it so. */
+		if (pm_resume_via_firmware())
+			dart->host_off_slept = true;
 		return 0;
 	}
 	/*
